{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05786","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其二 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天门豁兮仙台耸，杰屹崒兮零澒涌。\n穷三休兮旷一观，忽若登崑仑兮中期汗漫仙。\n耸天关兮倒景台，鲨颢气兮轶嚣埃。\n皎皎之子兮自独立，云可朋兮赮可吸，曾何荣辱之所及。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}